@startuml
!include style.puml
top to bottom direction

rectangle "Evidence Analysis\nWorker" as Agent #EEF5FA
rectangle "MCP Boundary" as MCP #FFF6E8
rectangle "Policy Check" as Policy #EEF5FA
rectangle "Scientific Software Adapter\nread-only" as Adapter #FFF6E8
rectangle "Approved Tidy3D\nExports" as Exports #F5F5F5

Agent -right-> MCP : import request
MCP -down-> Policy : check
Policy -down-> Adapter : allow
Exports -left-> Adapter : read export
@enduml
